WEBVTT

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.450
Okay, Kiri-chan.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.370
First, let's calm down!

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.140
Death!

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.910
<i>Stare...</i>

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.510
Let me see!

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.380
I can't bear to look at them.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.640
Yes! This is our trump card 
against the Philosopher's Stone!

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.310
The Fool's Stone!

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:52.020
I guess the "Fool's Stone" is 
the name it's stuck with...

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.120
My whole body and all my limbs feel so warm!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:39.670
The discoverer of the 
stone sure sounds smart.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.630
<b>Episode 8
In The Gap
Between Past and Future</b>

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.960
Hey, where's Elfnein-chan?

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.300
She ran off to get straight to work.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.740
To make a mud-covered miracle shine...

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.820
Our way to fight back: 
the Pair Annihilation Barrier.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.580
If we use the power of the Fool's Stone 
to neutralize the Philosopher's Stone...

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.100
Victory will be in our grasp.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.930
<i>But even if that's right, 
first we need to...</i>

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.600
A message came via the 
Foreign Ministry for you.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.010
A message? For me?

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:17.130
That family from Valverde wants to talk 
to you before they leave for home.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.840
Sorry.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.970
Tell them I'm busy.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.440
But...

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.740
Valverde...

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.500
Damn it all!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.080
You did this to my brother...

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:32.760
Yeah.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.550
I'm the one who pulled the trigger.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.540
Chris-chan...

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.750
The past is the past.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.970
You can't change the outcome of your choices.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:47.070
But if you continue to avert your eyes from it, 
you'll lose sight of what you must do now.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.490
Thanks for the warning.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.400
Yukine, you need to...

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.790
Okay, you're all here.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:57.930
Master! What's all this about?

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.830
Everyone, gather in the training room!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.920
Training?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.360
Old man, now that the 
Fool's Stone's been found,

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.480
there's no time for that!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.590
If this were a movie,

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.140
there's no way a single pebble 
could bring about a happy ending!

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.770
What the hell does that mean?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.700
You can complain after you kick some butt!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:42.340
It seems like the ritual to place 
the altar is going well.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.450
Yes.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:49.430
But we lack the life energy needed to 
establish the greater central control altar.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.730
Then use a sacrifice, perhaps.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.000
One of those two.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:02.030
That should make up the difference nicely...

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:06.260
The life energy that comes 
from a perfect body.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:11.210
Director... How inhuman can you be?

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:16.090
I think it's time for you 
to choose your justice.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.580
How is Prelati's recovery coming?

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.890
Quite well.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.640
It's going to take some time, though.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.810
A companion who shared our dream...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:30.540
Yes. No one can be allowed 
to hurt our companion.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:33.280
I've made my choice.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.890
Initiating training program.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:57.930
<i>A happy-go-lucky girl from the depths 
of hell, scaring demons dead pale</i>

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:03.120
<i>Waving around my scythe around</i>

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.880
<b>Calamity Ring Tinkerbell</b>

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:09.300
<i>With my trademark cross and pointed cap</i>

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.460
<b>α Style 100 Samsara</b>

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.840
<i>A dangerous girl's coming through!</i>

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:20.600
<i>I want to save the "Why?" in my heart</i>

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.230
<b>Thousand Falling Tears</b>

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:27.900
<i>but there's a melody of love that gives 
you warmth that's just for the two of us</i>

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.320
<b>Kill Juliet</b>

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.310
If you and I bring our songs 
together, Kiri-chan...

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.570
Zababa's blades show mercy to no one!

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.330
But that's still... so childish!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.310
This time, I'll be training you personally!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.340
No holding back!

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.960
I know I won't!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.070
Wh-What do I do?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.710
Maria?

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:06.550
I'm hesitant to attack a human being...

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.610
But I'm not sure he's human!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.150
Master! Please fight me!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.340
That dummy sure loves her training!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.830
Don't just charge at me!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:23.000
The commander is trying to tell us something 
by communicating with fists and hearts!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.350
But first...

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.560
The bucking bronco within 
me wants to do battle!

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.860
Splendid!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.220
Get ready to scream, old man!

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.630
You're kidding me!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.090
You can fire a lot of things,

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:06.050
but they amount to nothing
 if they don't come together!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.550
Match will and heart!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.620
Exploding Heart!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.680
Don't forget!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:27.090
The Fool's Stone is just a way to 
counteract the Philosopher's Stone!

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.720
Now, warm-ups are over!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.340
Then that was...

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.300
The real training begins now!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:34.990
Legends of the Heroes

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:43.340
Seven planets and seven scales!

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:47.050
The starry sky is like a musical score!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:50.760
Let us begin the ritual of creation, then.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.880
It's time for you to choose.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:12.360
Which life will you offer up?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:18.430
Now, what concerns me is the Symphogears.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.230
I'll go.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:24.430
You can't leave it to the one who's wounded, 
or the one who's stuck here doing the ritual.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.360
Do you have some plan?

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:32.450
The enemy's such a powerful foe 
that it's bad for my skin.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.990
I didn't want to lie anymore...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.620
But I'll use something a little tricky.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:50.920
So this is...

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:56.420
Yes, it was a rush job, but I included 
the Pair Annihilation Barrier system.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.240
They don't look any different...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.780
But now we won't lose to 
the Philosopher's Stone!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.790
Where are Tsubasa and Chris, by the way?

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.540
I gave them theirs already.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.250
They said they were going 
to meet someone they knew.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:18.540
I'm heading home this evening.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.290
But first, I wanted to tell you something.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.070
Okay...

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:29.230
They said things are looking good after the 
operation, so I can start physical therapy soon.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.420
I see...

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.740
I wanted to spend a little more time 
in a country without a civil war.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:38.110
But there are lots of kids waiting 
for my sister to get home.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:42.720
She's following in your parents' 
footsteps and supporting

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:46.080
those children who've lost 
their homes and families.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.170
<i>Following in mom and dad's footsteps?</i>

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.340
Inside the relief supplies we just loaded...

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:17.440
Dad! Mom!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.280
Dad! Mom!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.380
Let me go, Sonya!

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.720
No, it's dangerous!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.030
This is your fault, Sonya!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:33.560
<i>I knew that it wasn't her fault...</i>

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:38.250
<i>But, still...</i>

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:46.140
We're busy right now!

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:47.850
Alca-Noise?

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:53.590
Alca-Noise signals detected in Sector 7!

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.070
Ame no Habakiri and Ichaival, 
respond immediately!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.850
Hibiki-chan and the others are on their way!

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.410
Send in a request for evacuation.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.570
You two evacuate now!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.550
Roger!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.280
This is the perfect place to 
take out some frustration!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:20.050
<i>Killiter Ichaival tron.</i>

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:54.030
<i>It's time for the girl whose whole body's
 a weapon, the missile surfer</i>

00:12:54.030 --> 00:13:03.040
<i>The hit girl, giving you kisses with my 
bullets until the very last one runs out</i>

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:55.760
Wow...

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:09.920
<i>So where's the cherry who wants 
to get shot? Bang Bang Yeah</i>

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:16.210
<i>It seems like this world just isn't fair</i>

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.010
Looks like I succeeded in luring you out!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:21.130
<i>The enemy says they've got 
their reasons, too, right?</i>

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:22.020
They have engaged the enemy alchemist!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:28.980
<i>But if you're drawing your sword, 
then I'll show no mercy</i>

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.720
But the enemy came alone?

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:25.990
A diversion?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.910
Is it some kind of distraction?

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:34.910
<i>I won't let my bullets 
fly any way but straight</i>

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.650
Yukine, keep the enemy 
away from the building!

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:36.540
There are still civilians inside!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.850
<i>The night when I looked up at the moon 
and realized the past will never change</i>

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.030
I know!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.640
<i>So if you can't turn back the clock, 
what do you do about tomorrow?</i>

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.600
Stop jumping around!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:49.200
You're not as naughty a girl as you sound.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.090
Yukine!

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:00.250
I like you, but I'm going to kill you anyway.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.900
Are you okay, Chris-chan?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.400
You're late, dummy.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.030
<b>α Style 100 Samsara</b>

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.450
<b>Kill Juliet</b>

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.910
Thank you, Tsukuyomi, Akatsuki...

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.780
Sometimes we can save you!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.840
That's right! Time to turn this around!

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:30.580
That's right. Time to turn this around!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.040
Tsubasa-san!

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.270
Shirabe!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.550
What did you do?

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.770
The unison of the crimson 
blade Shul Shagana

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:49.330
and the green blade Igalima.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:54.750
Prelati learned the hard way that those 
are the two we need to watch out for.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.230
Sounds rather insulting...

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.470
You must not think much of us, huh?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.870
At this distance, ranged weapons won't...

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.350
Turns out she actually 
fights with her fists!

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.300
Maria!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:28.320
Victory pose!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.080
It's just the two of us!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.730
We're locked inside!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:34.280
It's just like before...

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:37.760
But since we can't find the 
control device at the center...

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:40.350
We'll have to break out by force!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.360
The training we did...

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.840
They're still here?

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:51.920
Stephan's wheelchair is...

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.720
Sorry for getting you involved.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:00.320
Don't worry. I'll get rid of you all now.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.960
I won't let—

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.030
A desperate attack?

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.660
What are you doing?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.210
You saved me before...

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.630
That's how I was able to save you now!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:30.960
The leg I lost... the past... 
it can never be changed!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.490
But I can change this moment,

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.100
and the future, too!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:37.060
Stephan...

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:41.070
Both you and my sister are obsessed 
with a past you can't change!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.850
I took a step forward on my new leg.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.770
What about you two?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.710
After all this encouragement,

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:06.410
I can't stay down forever, can I?

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:11.500
Time to finish this!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.670
You're late!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.500
But you look good, so I forgive you!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.230
Think you can do what you just did again?

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:26.140
Sure. I like that stuff.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.690
What are you talking about?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.420
Here you go!

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.830
Ignite?

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.300
Even with the light of the 
Lapis Philosophicus...

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:51.200
How?

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.720
These aren't the same Symphogears 
they were yesterday!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:04.810
<i>A thousand wounds are proof you didn't run</i>

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:09.850
<i>more than a thousand times 
in your past, right?</i>

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:14.860
<i>Because the clock never turns back,</i>

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:20.680
<i>that's why you can go to 
the world beyond it, right?</i>

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.480
<i>Is this unison?</i>

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:25.830
<i>Everyone fights and goes forward 
carrying the weight of their past</i>

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.120
<i>It's not just Zababa's blade?</i>

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.990
<i>Everyone has regrets</i>

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:35.170
<i>Taking hold of that sin and turning forward</i>

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:33.130
Pair Annihilation via the 
Fool's Stone confirmed!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.000
Ignite mode remains in effect!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.640
It worked!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:40.040
<i>Becomes a weapon to strike 
down hypocrisy and lies</i>

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:39.930
Phonic gain is rising exponentially!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.420
It appears to be the effect of the unison.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:45.930
<i>The past won't change, 
but you can change the future</i>

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.770
Can we do this?

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:47.380
The unison between Shirabe-kun 
and Kirika-kun is powerful!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:50.310
<i>A dualism where songs burn and howl</i>

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.860
That's why they'll probably 
attempt to split them up.

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:55.440
<i>Overlapping pain that will never disappear</i>

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.940
Don't just rely on the 
unique features of your gears!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:58.170
Bring your hearts together so that you sing 
together, no matter who your partner is!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.170
<i>Stick out your arm</i>

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.930
<i>Put it into your bullet</i>

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.570
A unison of bonds...

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:06.320
<i>And live and howl towards tomorrow</i>

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.340
First they stopped the Lapis's 
light, and then unison?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.860
I can't let the others fight them!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:12.800
<i>We pierced through one portion of the world</i>

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:18.140
<i>Longing for the strength to face our weakness</i>

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:22.700
<i>Believing in the hands we held</i>

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.370
I can't let you hurt them!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.950
A powerful energy...

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.020
Is she prepared to die?!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.710
My charm's about to explode!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:33.950
<i>With the hope that says "You can start now"</i>

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:38.390
<i>The weight we bear is not our enemy</i>

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:43.710
<i>It becomes an anchor to 
endure the rough waves</i>

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:48.410
<i>And keep us running from the fear</i>

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:53.950
<i>Unleash everything, 
all the power you've built up</i>

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:58.820
<i>Songs burn and become a storm of flames</i>

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:03.570
<i>Let us pair up together and 
play the score of battle</i>

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.630
Take the power...

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.460
<i>Let the beat go faster</i>

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:06.130
...to transcend this moment!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.980
<i>Endlessly hot</i>

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:14.420
<i>Even if it hurts, don't cry!</i>

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.580
We did it!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.710
Chris-chan!

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.020
Maria!

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.790
Is everyone okay?

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.260
Well, it worked out.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.240
<i>Chris, I'll see you again someday.</i>

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:59.180
<i>I'll see you soon. I swear.</i>

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.660
They got her! She disappeared!

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:22.820
Cagliostro became a star!

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.140
Shiny!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:27.120
No... Cagliostro!

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:30.480
Looks like you don't have to choose now.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.720
Prelati will be the sacrifice.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:36.940
Perfect. She's hurt, anyway.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.930
You're so...

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:43.120
Yes, I'm inhuman.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:46.770
You're absolutely correct.

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:53.080
Adam, you're inhuman! You're no good!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.830
Bad boys are always popular with the ladies!

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:02.890
The power of the gods matches 
that of the old rulers.

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:07.780
You need to be inhuman 
if you want to obtain it.
